ency and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6I6J6NOmtVYQ7kNvwElZtIH&_nc_oc=AdqMIG9HjA2YVUQ6mruJ1nqJOjyciUYWDbM_PL1W6vEunDw42A0HKbJLUq0oITeB6l4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7Fo1MCE3UQd8hdayYve69oyl2VfOZqo9vT3s-mHPTfiQ&oe=6A0C6639"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0FH2qHElkm8Q7kNvwELDNp7&_nc_oc=Adpqp2kY1numCEhwLHVVsAp70Ix953UO7oBJi4r3qQUTcWRCSBvWaQZolI_sOGZMmjU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af41iNSxTQ17RltY0Ddxyj_uPqiEcfPNTix6tIGUeTNtrg&oe=6A0C8CCF"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=grXmUroRHIIQ7kNvwGiSbFH&_nc_oc=AdoctQkG1MmIQKOBfrg-OQtdkH4lo0_8NIFcksz0VyTf-DrDqwfJfQwMj2MSrpPETw0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4wWr2bS-gRBqwfoVrtMsb0SaJSm6Eayb4ofnW0L8w6lw&oe=6A0C626E"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squa